        "updatedAt": "2026-09-05T18:59:02.161Z",
        "changeLog": "Global update : greatly optimized file size thanks to a new technique, increases game performance.\nI added more goofy swaps because I felt like they were missing in lower tiers :D\nnotable changes :\n\nfixed stug III G getting swapped instead of stug III B\nadded Gendron (goofy swap)\nAdded M4A1 FL 10 back\nsome scripts unfortunately don't work anymore since the new 2.4 update, I will update as soon as possible.\nadded UE 57 rocket\nKV1 now has a more noticable derp\nKV2 changed to lesta 3D style\nall T34-85 variants had a change\nlow tier guns like the SU-85 and more have had their gun swapped \nadded the first of the czech tanks\nOverhauled Mitsu_108's gun\nadded P26/40\nHetzer mega derp\n"
      },
      "current": {
        "modVersion": "1.8",
        "wotGameVersion": "2.4.0.0",
        "fileName": "WotVSWAPS-V1.8.zip",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-12T04:39:02.943Z",
        "changeLog": "Global update : greatly optimized file size thanks to a new technique, increases game performance.\nI added more goofy swaps because I felt like they were missing in lower tiers :D\nnotable changes :\n\nfixed stug III G getting swapped instead of stug III B\nadded Gendron (goofy swap)\nAdded M4A1 FL 10 back\nsome scripts unfortunately don't work anymore since the new 2.4 update, I will update as soon as possible.\nadded UE 57 rocket\nKV1 now has a more noticable derp\nKV2 changed to lesta 3D style\nall T34-85 variants had a change\nlow tier guns like the SU-85 and more have had their gun swapped \nadded the first of the czech tanks\nOverhauled Mitsu_108's gun\nadded P26/40\nHetzer mega derp\n"
      }
